        "n": "NTS GUIDE TO: MUSIC FROM JAPAN’S CD-ERA ELECTRONIC UNDERGROUND (R)",
        "s": "2026-09-10T02:00:00+01:00",
        "e": "2026-09-10T04:00:00+01:00",
        "d": "A journey through Japan’s quietly radical independent underground of the late ‘90s and early 2000s. Drawn from small-run CDs, obscure compilations, and deeply interconnected label networks, reflecting a moment where ambient, glitch, IDM, and experimental club sounds flourished into new forms — shaped by a generation of artists working across clubs, galleries, and record shops.\nCreated by Cameron Cullen",
        "j": "MUSIC FROM JAPAN’S CD-ERA ELECTRONIC UNDERGROUND",
